（保有目的）過去の事業譲渡の実績等も踏まえ、取引関係維持のため
（定量的な保有効果）（注）
</jpcrp030000-asr_E03391-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">無</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">上新電機㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03391-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">
保有の合理性を検証した結果、当事業年度において、一部売却いたしました。
なお、提出日現在は全株売却しており、保有しておりません。
</jpcrp030000-asr_E03391-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">無</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">㈱G-7ホールディングス</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03391-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">
