&lt;h6&gt;（１株当たり情報）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 6px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 642.00000000000000000000000001px"&gt;
